# L §5.19 example observations, copied whole, with the places, the move rent and the rows they name completed.
# Expected from the stated rules: konto (alive before S, no opening) has no balance before its first reading
# (HOLE-ANCHOR, L §5.10, §8.1); "pad x from y: ... x's balance after the instant is the reading": 4 150.00 PLN at
# 2025-11-30 end, and the gap (the reading less a booked balance that is a hole) is a hole, so the pad's amount is
# one (L §5.19 Holes); after it, "a balance means what the statement states at the last reading, plus what is booked
# since": rent[2025-12] (uncovered day, booked, unfulfilled) gives 1 350.00 PLN.  On the covered day the observation
# books the landlord's end from itself (E §6.1) and rent[2025-11] is modelled past, never booked: flows(landlord,
# 2025-11) = 2 800.00 PLN.  observed(m[k]) sums the legs of the observations that fulfil it, `none` when none does.
# covered(x, span) is true when versions cover x on every day of the span.  fund[r3] books both its legs (ike is
# covered; the other ends from the observation).
# (Writer 8: L §5.10 refuses a unit stated on a place whose kind isn't of unit one, so `outside PLN` is gone; the place
# read by flows is now a thing of its own outside kind of one unit, `kind payees: place PLN signed outside`, since
# flows of a place of unit any is refused, L §5.14.3.)
=== m.tally
model hh
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2025-10-01
  end 2026-12-31

source bank_export_2025_11 "bank"
source fund_register "fund"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind funds: unit

kind groceries: transfers
kind fund_buys: event certain
  leg units: funds
  leg cash: PLN

input bank: observed
input fund: observed
input rent_amt: money PLN
input rent_off: int

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
kind payees: place PLN signed outside
place landlord: payees lives 1900-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place market: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place ike: holdings etf lives 2026-01-01..
place ike_cash: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

move rent[m in months]: transfers
  on add_days(start_of(m), rent_off)
  leg cash from konto to landlord amount rent_amt

version units
  cite fund_register
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  funds + [etf] lives 2020-01-01..
  rent_amt = 2 800.00 PLN
  rent_off = 2

version statement_11
  cite bank_export_2025_11
  governs 2025-11
  known 2025-12-01
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank[r17] = (on: 2025-11-03, kind: transfers, leg cash from konto to landlord amount 2 800.00 PLN, fulfils: rent[2025-11]) "line 17"
  bank[r18] = (on: 2025-11-04, kind: groceries, leg cash from konto to world amount 234.22 PLN) "BIEDRONKA 1234"
  stated[konto] = 4 150.00 PLN at 2025-11-30 end "saldo końcowe"

version register_2026_02
  cite fund_register
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-05
  covers ike
  fund[r3] = (on: 2026-02-02, kind: fund_buys, leg units from market to ike amount 4.2167 etf, leg cash from ike_cash to market amount 500.00 PLN) "register line 3"

ask before: bal(konto, 2025-10-31)
ask nov: bal(konto, 2025-11-30)
ask dec: bal(konto, 2025-12-31)
ask land: flows(landlord, 2025-11)
ask obs: observed(rent[2025-11]).cash.amount, observed(rent[2025-12]) == none
ask cov: covered(konto, 2025-11), covered(konto, 2025-10-15 .. 2025-11-15)
ask ike_: bal(ike, 2026-02-28), bal(ike_cash, 2026-02-28)
ask n: count(o in bank over 2025-11)
=== expect
before: ?"konto has no balance before 2025-11-30" (konto)
  unfulfilled: rent[2025-10]
  cut 2026-10-20
cov: (true, false)
  cut 2026-10-20
dec: 1 350.00 PLN
  pad: konto 2025-11-30 end, pads:statement_11:konto@2025-11-30 end of ?"konto has no balance before 2025-11-30" (konto)
  unfulfilled: rent[2025-12]
  cut 2026-10-20
ike_: (4.2167 etf, -500.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-10-20
land: 2 800.00 PLN
  cut 2026-10-20
n: 2
  cut 2026-10-20
nov: 4 150.00 PLN
  pad: konto 2025-11-30 end, pads:statement_11:konto@2025-11-30 end of ?"konto has no balance before 2025-11-30" (konto)
  cut 2026-10-20
obs: (2 800.00 PLN, true)
  cut 2026-10-20
